        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Geoff Capes, Ab Wolders\n- Events: 1986 World's Strongest Man\n- Places: Nice, France; United Kingdom; Netherlands\n- Roles: champion, shot putter, strongman, professional Highland Games competitor\n\nFacts:\n- Geoffrey Lewis Capes was born on 23 August 1949.\n- Geoffrey Lewis Capes is a British former shot putter, strongman, and professional Highland Games competitor.\n- Geoff Capes was the 1983 and 1985 World's Strongest Man champion.\n- The 1986 World's Strongest Man contest was held in Nice, France.\n- Geoff Capes from the United Kingdom finished second at the 1986 World's Strongest Man contest.\n- Ab Wolders from the Netherlands finished third at the 1986 World's Strongest Man contest.",
